        },
        {
          "text": " Nao watumishi wote wa mfalme, walioketi langoni pa mfalme, wakainama na kumsujudia Hamani, maana ndivyo mfalme alivyoamuru wamfanyie. Lakini Mordekai hakumwinamia, wala kumsujudia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi watumishi wa mfalme walioketi langoni pa mfalme wakamwambia Mordekai, Mbona wewe waivunja amri ya mfalme? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa, waliposema naye kila siku asiwasikilize, wakamwarifu Hamani, ili kuona kama mambo yake Mordekai yatasimama; maana alikuwa amewaambia ya kuwa yeye ni Myahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
